  "description": "Existing use of property as Class C4 HMO prior to the introduction of Article 4 Direction in December 2025 (Application for a Certificate of Lawful Development for an Existing Use)",
  "decision_conditions": [
    "The existing development does not constitute Lawful Development under Section 191 of Town and Country Planning Act 1990, Section 191 as amended by Section 10 of the Planning and Compensation Act 1991, as the Applicant has not sufficiently demonstrated that on the balance of probability, that the conversion of the property from a dwelling (Use Class C3) to a small HMO (Use Class C4) occurred prior to 11.12.2025 - the date that the Council's immediate Article 4 Direction to remove Permitted Development rights borough-wide for such conversions came into effect."
